|i1 : Q= cellCollection {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {3, 1}, {3, 2}, {3, 3}, {2, 3}, {1,  |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|3}, {1, 2}};                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : J=polyoToric(Q,{{2,2}})                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = ideal (- x   x    + x   x   , - x   x    + x   x   , - x   x    +       |
|               2,2 1,1    2,1 1,2     3,2 1,1    3,1 1,2     4,2 1,1         |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     x   x   , - x   x    + x   x   , - x   x    + x   x   , - x   x    +    |
