+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : standardRookPolynomial Q                           |
|                                                        |
|       2                                                |
|o2 = 4t  + 5t + 1                                       |
|                                                        |
|o2 : ZZ[t]                                              |
+--------------------------------------------------------+

