  * Inputs:
      * Q, a collection of cells
  * Outputs:
      * the graph whose vertices correspond to cells and edges to adjacency
        relations

Description
===========

Constructs the adjacency graph $G$ of a collection of cells, where the vertices
of $G$ are the cells and two vertices of $G$ are connected by an edge in $G$ if
the corresponding two cells share a common side.

+--------------------------------------------------+
