|                                                  |
|o2 = Graph{0 => {1, 2}}                           |
|           1 => {0, 3}                            |
|           2 => {0, 3}                            |
|           3 => {1, 2}                            |
|                                                  |
|o2 : Graph                                        |
+--------------------------------------------------+

